repository-code: "https://github.com/mahmodianf-bit/TLH-AFP"

abstract: "TLH-AFP integrates ESM-2, ProstT5, ChemBERTa, and handcrafted sequence features for antifungal peptide prediction through fold-wise Random Forest feature selection, a primary-complementary architecture, cross-attention, and supervised contrastive learning."

keywords:
  - antifungal peptides
  - AFP prediction
  - ESM-2
  - protein language models
  - multi-representation learning
  - cross-attention
  - feature selection
  - supervised contrastive learning
